<title>USA: U.S. cash soymeal - Basis offers steady to weak.</title>
<headline>U.S. cash soymeal - Basis offers steady to weak.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Higher CBOT soymeal futures had buyers seeking product for immediate needs but delaying additional purchases, soymeal dealers said.</p>
<p>Also, dealers doubt livestock feed consumption will increase soon because hot weather forecast for later this week through the Midwest should stress livestock and curb feed consumption, they said.</p>
<p>Supplies of competing feed ingredients appeared adequate for demand which has kept a lid of soymeal basis values, sources said.</p>
<p>Overall basis offers were steady to weak.  </p>
